{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two worlds exist in a delicate balance:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nav\u0101</strong> \u2014 a land of boundless magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3318110/extras/06dd68cb6cf2dd867dd854851d0cb68a.avif?t=1759710864\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Terra</strong> \u2014 a marvel of cutting-edge technology.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3318110/extras/3c53d7eb9db45b8ddc73742ef8810208.avif?t=1759710864\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But, the ancient barriers between these worlds are breaking down.<br>You wake up to discover you're a doppelg\u00e4nger \u2014 a rare being with connections to both worlds, placing you at the center of this world-changing conflict.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3318110/extras/d28212d01019429142a6305cd870d2df.avif?t=1759710864\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><br>Powerful leaders want to exploit this chaos:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you join\u00a0<strong><i>The Extinctionists</i></strong>, who demand one world\u2019s dominance?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3318110/extras/1a9f031ab27a1a17f70479f786de44cc.avif?t=1759710864\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or <strong><i>The Expansionists</i></strong>, who dream of unity?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3318110/extras/d90df9bb04a114c90e811b6ee79e34b8.avif?t=1759710864\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or forge your own path, torn between love, vengeance, and duty?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3318110/extras/83bbba10574addd89e79176881e36fd4.avif?t=1759710864\" data-has-big width=800 height=458 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3318110?t=1759710864","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3318110?t=1759710864","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3318110/4d5e823b61b3b8e1177ba1201e233086ae5371f2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759710864","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3318110/4d5e823b61b3b8e1177ba1201e233086ae5371f2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759710864","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,3,4,5],"notes":"This game is for adults only. All characters engaging in sexual or roleplay scenes, including BDSM activity, are at least 18 years old, and all sexual acts are consensual.\r\n\r\nWhile not the main focus of the story, The Last Star Walker includes realistic, non-glamorized depictions of drug and alcohol abuse, physical abuse, trauma, bullying, violence, gore and subtle elements of self-harm, along with their impact on those involved.